OL,3,ARevolut outage hits 'multiple services'
OL,4,Aas thousands of users report app issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FRevolut has been hit by an outage which
OL,7,Fit says is impacting "multiple
OL,8,Fservices", as thousands of customers
OL,9,Freport problems.
OL,11,FUsers of the British bank have flagged
OL,12,Fbeing unable to make some payments or
OL,13,Faccess funds via its app on Tuesday
OL,14,Fmorning.
OL,16,FPlatform outage monitor Downdetector
OL,17,Fhad seen more than 1,500 user reports
OL,18,Fof issues with Revolut services shortly
OL,19,Fafter 08:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
