OL,3,ARevolut outage hits 'multiple services'
OL,4,Aas thousands of users report app issues
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are currently experiencing a
OL,7,Fservice disruption affecting multiple
OL,8,Fservices," a Revolut spokesperson told
OL,9,Fthe BBC - adding "we can confirm that
OL,10,Fall our customers' money and data are
OL,11,Fsafe."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
