OL,4,Aprosthetics helped his performance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh actor said he spent about
OL,7,Fhalf of his time on the set with the
OL,8,Fspecial effects make-up team,
OL,9,Ftransforming into the mutant villain.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
